iv><br><br>Your main goal is the development of your base and the production of combat units that will allow you to defend your city and in turn assault the enemy's compound. The game starts with several basic structures, i.e.:<br>The Nexus \u2013 your headquarters and the heart of your base,<br>Barracks \u2013 increases population,<br>Defense turrets \u2013 targets aerial and ground hostiles,<br>Refinery \u2013 extracts resources needed for assembling additional units.<br>These buildings will be the foundation for further development of your base and the choice of producing units to be controlled in TPP. You'll mainly use turrets to defend your base while the offensive will make use of various mobile battle vehicles, capable of long-range travel.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826590/extras/a3e8db41076ac557f8a8456e4fcef0da.poster.avif?t=1678350668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826590/extras/a3e8db41076ac557f8a8456e4fcef0da.webm?t=1678350668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826590/extras/a3e8db41076ac557f8a8456e4fcef0da.mp4?t=1678350668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Another important matter is the production and management of automatons responsible for collecting the parts of destroyed machines and constructing new buildings from available materials. These units will essentially serve as the lifeblood of your entire operation and their number will always be under your control via the Nexus.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826590/extras/49cae64f85c1b5b1d2fcfc687347e3de.poster.avif?t=1678350668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826590/extras/49cae64f85c1b5b1d2fcfc687347e3de.webm?t=1678350668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826590/extras/49cae64f85c1b5b1d2fcfc687347e3de.mp4?t=1678350668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Aside from building up your base, the main goal of the game will be to vanquish the enemy Nexus which constitutes a threat to your faction. In this time of incredible threat, will you be capable of triggering the right survival instincts to bring out your best sense of logistics and piloting deadly machines? You'll find out soon enough because an all-out war is on its way!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826590/extras/54151f3bc2b09639238f194c7ccbb481.poster.avif?t=1678350668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826590/extras/54151f3bc2b09639238f194c7ccbb481.webm?t=1678350668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826590/extras/54151f3bc2b09639238f194c7ccbb481.mp4?t=1678350668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
